+| Gap | Action (actor) | Closing fact |
+|---|---|---|
+| ready task, branch absent | build the environment: continue its need's branch, or fork the target's head (else main's) and carry each need's unmerged change, conflicts as unmerged entries (registry and one transaction; P4a's prepare generalized from one source to the needs) | the branch with its base and target recorded |
