+| ready task, environment complete, no open attempt | the start step: write the attempt row, acquire a context, run the stale members by reach digest, judge `done-refusals` (root, no graph, no model) | the attempt row and the step's results |
+| the start step judged empty | the done step at once: no graph, no model call | outcome `:done`, or main written |
+| the start step left work, or an open attempt with no graph and work left | start the graph (registry) | `:seon.agent/graph-process` |
+| ready task, environment incomplete | report the missing members as a problem task and hold the task (root); nothing starts with a default standing in | the problem task and `:held` |
+| a graph whose attempt ended, task not `:running`, or environment differs | stop and join the graph; on an environment difference close the attempt "environment changed" and let the next pass start a fresh agent (registry, root) | `graph-process` retracted, `:closed` |
+| attempt ended `:done` | judge `done-refusals` at the end commit; empty: the done step; refused: bail | the done step's write, or the bail |
+| attempt ended any other way | bail: problem task on main, `:held`, outcome `:closed` with its reason (root) | `:held`, `:closed` |
+| merged, publication due | `seon.merge/publish!` | `git-commit` or a refusal |
+| a branch none of whose tasks is runnable or open | end it (`seon.task/end-branch!`) | the branch gone or kept |
